1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:08,190
You know, the charge of loitering was created to keep black folk from gathering.

2
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:18,650
And some would like to convince you that that would be because, well, when black folk gathered, they made plans.

3
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,370
They were violent.

4
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:27,950
When black folk gathered, they revolted.

5
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,010
They're not wrong.

6
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,150
The Black Panthers was formed at Merritt College.

7
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:40,670
The Student Nonviolent Coordinating Committee, SNCC, was formed at Fisk University.

8
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:54,090
And the Black Campus Movement, I think it was from like 65 to the early 70s, was a bunch of black folks on campuses all over the nation.

9
00:00:54,810 --> 00:01:02,650
PWI, the NHBCU saying, yeah, we're going to need to get classes that are specifically about African-American studies since we don't ever learn about none of this.

10
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:05,050
We're also going to need some black student unions.

11
00:01:05,050 --> 00:01:16,350
When we get together, the multi-pronged approach to liberation happens like Voltron.

12
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:20,410
I just want y'all to know that it doesn't have to happen on the college campus.

13
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:22,770
It doesn't have to happen in a church.

14
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:24,750
It can happen anywhere.

15
00:01:25,390 --> 00:01:27,050
It can happen in a prison commissary.

16
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:31,630
And it will continue to happen everywhere, no matter how hard they try to stop it.

